hb_rf_eth: add timeout module parameters and robustness fixes

Allow deployments with routed or slightly higher-latency network paths to tune
the HB-RF-ETH connection watchdog and reconnect handshake timeout without
changing the default behavior.

Also fix a reconnect-path receive buffer leak, add missing allocation checks,
return the correct error when generic_raw_uart_probe() fails, and only log
connect sysfs file creation failures when an error actually occurred.

Upstream: Pending
Signed-off-by: An Zimber <anzimber@users.noreply.github.com>

